  "id": "the-naked-director-s01e07-scene-04",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "保釈金の一億集めてこい  (Raise the One Hundred Million Yen Bail)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kawada": "川田",
    "student": "生徒",
    "toshi": "トシ"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At the company office, Toshi loses his temper when the crew returns empty-handed, and Kawada explains they must raise one hundred million yen by next month for a plea bargain to free Muranishi. Listen for \"shihou torihiki\", a legal plea bargain.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "おめえらよ、ホントに使えねえな！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "すいません、役に立てなくて。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "一円も稼いでねえじゃねえかよ！本気でやってんのかよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "しかたないだろ！こんな状況ですぐに対応できるはずがない。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "悠長なこと言ってる場合じゃねえんだよ！今すぐ金が必要なんだよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "分かってます。何かできることを考えます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "何とか司法取引を成立させよう。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "金さえ払えば、村西さんは釈放される。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "来月までに保釈金の一億、死ぬ気で集めてこい！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "実際のとこ、どうなんだよ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "間に合うわけないよ。一億だぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "バカかお前、池沢に頼んだらおっさんが納得しねえよ！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "おめえらよ、ホントに使えねえな！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You guys are seriously useless!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "すいません、役に立てなくて。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am sorry I couldn't be of help.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "一円も稼いでねえじゃねえかよ！本気でやってんのかよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You haven't earned a single yen! Are you even trying seriously!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "しかたないだろ！こんな状況ですぐに対応できるはずがない。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Give them a break! Nobody can adjust right away in a situation like this.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "悠長なこと言ってる場合じゃねえんだよ！今すぐ金が必要なんだよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is no time for leisurely talk! We need cash right now!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "分かってます。何かできることを考えます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We understand. We will think of something we can do.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "何とか司法取引を成立させよう。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let's find a way to close a plea bargain.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "金さえ払えば、村西さんは釈放される。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'As long as we pay the money, Muranishi will be released.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "来月までに保釈金の一億、死ぬ気で集めてこい！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Scrape together the one hundred million yen bail by next month with everything you have!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "実際のとこ、どうなんだよ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In reality, how do things look?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "間に合うわけないよ。一億だぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There is no way we will make it in time. It is a hundred million yen.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "バカかお前、池沢に頼んだらおっさんが納得しねえよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you crazy, if we begged Ikezawa the boss would never stand for it!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
